  "description": "HD Fighters 1.1: 218 texture entries covering 69 named characters, main/additional outfits, identified in-engine Story states and secondary/injury maps. All 213 fighter atlas/secondary entries have AI-assisted Rich Original Detail restorations with source-palette matching and preserved material alpha; five shared sparkle/tape inputs retain native pixels. Version 1.1 restores the final 13 entries using Gemini, with 205 texture files unchanged. No mesh or gameplay changes. Created-player customization, portraits, menus and prerecorded video are separate. Requires game 0.12.1; Faithful HD is optional. Original protectable contributions are CC BY-NC 4.0; original game artwork is excluded.",
